Third-party notices
===================

FFmpeg (optional, via ffmpeg-static)
------------------------------------

demotale prefers a system FFmpeg on PATH. If you install `ffmpeg-static` yourself,
that package downloads a platform-specific FFmpeg binary licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later (depending on how a given build was configured). demotale
invokes that binary as a separate process; it does not link against FFmpeg as a
library.

- FFmpeg: https://ffmpeg.org/
- ffmpeg-static: https://github.com/eugeneware/ffmpeg-static

If you redistribute demotale together with a bundled FFmpeg binary, you must
comply with the license terms of that binary.

